Two new achievements have been added to the game, for which you can get rewards:
1. Live 30 days;
2. Repair the boat.

notes.content:
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32200705/72ea55ea92840b33f37992187106a21e0fe3cace.png[/img]

Now in the game the player can change skins! A wardrobe was installed on the base (it is outlined with a white stripe). 10 completely [b] free skins [/ b] for the main character were added to the game:
1. Russian man;
2. Biker;
3. Shaolin;
4. Cowboy;
5. Reper;
6. Medic.
7. Specialist in radiation safety;
8. Classic;
9. The officer;
10. The traveler.

Also, a critical error in working with inventory was fixed in the game. Specifically, a problem could sometimes arise when removing an item from a satchel.
